OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in early morning
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died and two other people
OL,7,Fhave been seriously injured in
OL,8,Fcollision involving five vehicles,
OL,9,Fpolice said.
OL,11,FThe collision took place on the A605
OL,12,Fbetween Warmington in Northamptonshire
OL,13,Fand Elton in Cambridgeshire at about
OL,14,F01:30 GMT.
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire Police said a BMW 2
OL,17,Fand BMW X6 were being driven in
OL,18,Fopposite directions when they crashed.
OL,19,FThe drivers of two HGVs stopped to help
OL,20,Fand a Kia Ceed then collided with the
OL,21,Fstationary BMW 2.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
