OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in early morning
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the BMW X6, a woman in
OL,7,Fher 40s, died of her injuries. The
OL,8,Fdriver of the BMW 2, a man in his 20s,
OL,9,Fhad serious injuries and has been
OL,10,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,11,Fby dangerous driving.
